# QA: a pointer resting (not moving) over the window steals keyboard/gamepad focus when a new
# screen appears under it. hover_steal.sh parks the pointer over the Settings "Hints" row's
# position (empty space in the main menu) before the game starts.
wait ui
3.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
1.5 shot hs_01_main
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Settings
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 shot hs_02_settings_opened     # expected: focus on Speed units (row 0)
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # expected: km/h → mph
1.0 shot hs_03_after_right
0.3 nav keyboardA back
1.0 exit
